        {
            "title": "New Release - Europa Universalis III Spritepacks",
            "date": "2011-06-23 18:15:00",
            "url": "http://store.steampowered.com/news/5720/",
            "notes": " \nAll new <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25809/\">Eastern</a> and <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25810/\">Western</a> Spritepacks are now available for <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25800/\">Europa Universalis III</a>!<br><br>Each pack adds 16 new uniform sprites for European nations.<br><br>In celebration of this release, <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25800/\">EUIII Complete</a> and <a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/sub/7654/\">EUIII Chronicles</a> are 75% off until June 30th at 10AM Pacific Time!<br><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25810/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/25810/capsule_231x87.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 87px; width: 231px;\"></a><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25809/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/25809/capsule_231x87.jpg\" style=\" float: none; margin-left: 12px; height: 87px; width: 231px;\"></a><br><a href=\"http://store.steampowered.com/app/25800/\"><img src=\"http://storefront.steampowered.com/v/gfx/apps/25800/capsule_467x181.jpg\" style=\" float: left; margin-right: 12px; height: 181px; width: 467px;\"></a>\t\t\t\t"
